{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14404","headline":"感怀二首 二 · 戴叔伦","name":"感怀二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"主人饮君酒，劝君弗相违。\n但当尽弘量，觞至无复辞。\n人生百年中，会合能几时。\n不见枝上花，昨满今渐稀。\n花落还再开，人老无少期。\n古来贤达士，饮酒不复疑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14404.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14404","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}